  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2203.03 Information Required for Certification. The applicant shall complete and submit to the department the \"Salt Applicator Certification Application for Initial Renewal or Certification\" form, NHDES-W-07-051, May 2024, available at: https://onlineforms.nh.gov/?formtag=NHDES-W-07-051.\n\nSource. #10697, eff 10-18-14 (from Env-Wq 2204.03); amd by #12530, eff 6-1-18; ss by #13982, eff 5-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq2200.html"
